    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d3-a4">

                <pb facs="0741" n="591" sameAs="frus:frus1907p2/pg591"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure
                    3.—Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Ramon Chan to Minister Combs.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Antonio</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-08-27"><hi rendition="#italic">August 27,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Giving your excellency a thousand thanks for you kindness, and at present I have
                    been set free under bail. In my next letter I will give you more details of my
                    affair. Wishing you happiness in union of your esteemed family.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ramon Chan.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
